SEQUENCE ALIGNMENT
------------------

Input data: 6 taxa with 4 partitions and 11464 total sites (11.491% missing data)

  ID  Name     Type	Seq	Site	Unique	Infor	Invar	Const
   1  COX1     DNA	6	1554	94	99	1276	1276
   2  ND2+ND1  DNA	6	2006	111	152	1654	1654
   3  RAG2     DNA	5	3193	97	22	3074	3074
   4  RAG1     DNA	5	4711	28	7	4687	4687

Column meanings:
  Unique: Number of unique site patterns
  Infor:  Number of parsimony-informative sites
  Invar:  Number of invariant sites
  Const:  Number of constant sites (can be subset of invariant sites)

ModelFinder
-----------

Best-fit model according to BIC: HKY+F+G4:COX1,HKY+F+I+G4:ND2+ND1,HKY+F+I:RAG2,K2P+I:RAG1

List of best-fit models per partition:

  ID  Model                  LogL         AIC      w-AIC        AICc     w-AICc         BIC      w-BIC
   1  HKY+F+G4          -3685.735    7383.470 + 5.18e-310    7383.524 + 6.95e-310    7415.562 + 2.12e-314
   2  HKY+F+I+G4        -4759.046    9532.091 + 5.18e-310    9532.147 + 6.95e-310    9571.319 + 2.12e-314
   3  HKY+F+I           -5253.560   10519.120 + 5.18e-310   10519.146 + 6.95e-310   10555.532 + 2.12e-314
   4  K2P+I             -6734.401   13474.801 + 5.18e-310   13474.806 + 6.95e-310   13494.174 + 2.12e-314

AIC, w-AIC   : Akaike information criterion scores and weights.
AICc, w-AICc : Corrected AIC scores and weights.
BIC, w-BIC   : Bayesian information criterion scores and weights.

Plus signs denote the 95% confidence sets.
Minus signs denote significant exclusion.

SUBSTITUTION PROCESS
--------------------

Edge-linked-proportional partition model with separate substitution models and separate rates across sites

  ID  Model           Speed  Parameters
   1  HKY+F+G4       2.0623  HKY{77.3387}+F{0.262205,0.232568,0.188275,0.316952}+G4{0.200936}
